Under this identification, the CR structure on \(H_n\) described above coincides with the CR structure on \(M_n\) induced from \( {C}^{n+1}\). (Indeed, one easily checks that the holomorphic subspaces at the origin are the same since \(M_n\) is tangent to the hyperplane \( _0 = 0\) there. But the CR structure on \(H_n\) is left-invariant, and the action of \(H_n\) on \(M_n\), being holomorphic, preserves the CR structure on \(M_n\); hence the holomorphic subspaces coincide everywhere.)

